&gt;AI 变得越来越普世之后，很多“民间开发者”自发涌现出来。比如我最近看到一个项目，有网友将家里的小米蓝牙遥控器改造为 Vibe Coding 的语音输入手柄，主打一个 AI 变废为宝。某天深夜，我看了看压在泡面上的 Kindle，思绪良久。自从 Kindle 中国电子书店停止运营，它大部分时间的作用如此。说起来，这台2015年的 Kindle Paperwhite 3 到现在依然好好的。只是每次想...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843402.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>前英伟达总监忆黄仁勋：作风强硬 骨子里很温暖</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843406.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抓取被服务器拒绝&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843406.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>高盛“恐慌指数”逼近最大值：美股下周恐还有抛售</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843410.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.com//adserver.wenxuecity.com/202512/1770925882861.png" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"&gt;WENXUECITY.COM does not represent or guarantee the truthfulness, accuracy, or reliability of any of communications posted by other users. Copyright ©1998-2026wenxuecity.comAll rights reserved.Privacy ...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843410.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美媒称五角大厦密令限制美加防务合作 加方回应</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843416.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抓取被服务器拒绝&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843416.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:25 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>墨西哥逮捕FBI十大通缉毒枭 当地爆枪战暴力</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843418.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.com//adserver.wenxuecity.com/202512/1770925882861.png" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"&gt;Mexico’s military captured FBI-wanted cartel leader ‘El Chapo Isidro’ in Guasave, Sinaloa. Armed clashes erupted as helicopters opened fire, vehicles burned and roads were blocked. Gunfire also halted...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843418.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:24 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>黄仁勋同意赴美国会公开作证 间谍疑云成焦点</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843419.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抓取被服务器拒绝&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843419.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>黄仁勋下一站是英特尔？辉达恐掀人才出走潮</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843421.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抓取被服务器拒绝&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843421.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>川普嗨跳YMCA画面曝光 习近平随音乐忙着鼓掌</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843422.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.com//adserver.wenxuecity.com/202512/1770925882861.png" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"&gt;21个经济体的领导人11月18日（周三）齐聚深圳，出席亚太经合组织（APEC）第33次领导人非正式会议。美国白宫传讯顾问马丁（Margo Martin）在网上发影片分享，总统川普（Donald Trump）在深圳与中国国家主席习近平出席欢迎午宴时，随着现场有舞者演唱他的专属音乐《Y.M.C.A.》，川普站着挥动手臂，晒了一下他的“标准舞姿”，而习近平及中方官员则随着音乐的节奏拍掌，场面轻松欢乐。来...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843422.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:19 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>301调查将完成 明年美中贸易休兵协议恐生变</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843424.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.com//adserver.wenxuecity.com/202512/1770925882861.png" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"&gt;美国贸易代表葛里尔表示，预料美方“很快”会完成依三百○一条款展开的产能过剩调查，可能为明年元月告终的美中贸易休兵增添变数。葛里尔廿日接受彭博电视访问时，被问及调查结束时点，他回答，相关程序“肯定”会在年底前完成，但拒绝提供更多细节，说明哪些国家可能被加征关税。美国贸易代表署（ＵＳＴＲ）正就各国工业产能过剩，编制一份高度受瞩目的报告。外界埋怨，这类行为让世界各国充斥廉价货品，陷美国劳工于不利。这类所...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843424.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>郭文贵曼哈顿豪宅贱卖易主 买家惊人身份曝光</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843425.html?v=1795311791</link><description>&lt;div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"&gt;&lt;img src="https://www.wenxuecity.com//adserver.wenxuecity.com/202512/1770925882861.png" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; display: block;" /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="font-size: 14px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"&gt;流亡美国的大陆富商郭文贵位于纽约曼哈顿的顶级豪宅近日正式易主，最终以800万美元的骨折价售出。这座位于知名酒店The Sherry-Netherland 18楼的整层豪宅，当年由郭文贵以6750万美元买下，如今惨赔近6000万美元脱手，不仅创下纽约市史上单一住宅交易的“最大亏损纪录”，新买家更被起底是足球金童贝克汉长媳妮寇拉的亲兄弟。根据外媒《New York Post》报导，这座豪宅拥有7000...&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843425.html?v=1795311791</guid><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:43:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普重申：寻求与伊朗达成“永久性”协议</title><link>https://www.wenxuecity.com/news/2026/11/21/126843447.html?v=1795311791</link><d